eleased?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>It is has be released on <strong data-start=\"232\" data-end=\"257\">05 February 2026</strong>.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. Where can I download SSC Phase 13 Result 2026?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>You can download it from the official website <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" style=\"color: #000000;\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"404\">ssc.nic.in</a>.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What login details are required to download the Result 2026?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong> You need your <strong data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"519\">Registration Number</strong> and <strong data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"550\">Password/Date of Birth</strong>.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. In which format will the Result be available?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>It will be available in <strong data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"656\">PDF format</strong>.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. Will SSC provide the Response Sheet along with the Result?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong> Yes, candidates will also be able to check their <strong data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"804\">Response Sheet</strong>.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. Will the SSC Phase 13 Result be based on the Answer Key?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>Yes, the result will be prepared on the basis of the <strong data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1449\">Final Answer Key</strong>.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is SSC Official Website?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The Official Website of SSC is https://ssc.gov.in/</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
